    "description": "The AI-Based Mental Health Support Chatbot is an intelligent virtual assistant designed to provide emotional support, basic mental health guidance, and a safe space for users to express their feelings. The chatbot uses Natural Language Processing (NLP) and Machine Learning (ML) techniques to understand user inputs and respond in a human-like, empathetic manner.\nThis project aims to make mental health support more accessible, affordable, and stigma-free, especially for individuals who may hesitate to seek professional help.\n\nObjectives\nProvide 24/7 emotional support through conversation\nHelp users manage stress, anxiety, and mood swings\nEncourage positive mental habits (journaling, breathing, affirmations)\nGuide users to professional help when needed",
