    "description": "We are making a smart watch for elderly people. \nMany elderly people are at risk of accidental falls, especially when they are alone or outdoors. In emergency situations, they may not be able to call for help quickly. Existing systems are expensive, depend on smartphones, or require internet connectivity.\nOur project is a smart wearable wristband that detects falls using sensors and activates a voice assistant to ask the user if they are okay. If there is no response, the system automatically sends an SMS alert with GPS location and heart rate information to family members using GSM technology. The device works without internet and provides quick emergency support for elderly safety..",
