    "description": "Our project is about creating a platform for FinTech and business operations. This platform is for medium enterprises (MSMEs) restaurants, startups and small businesses in India.\n\nWe visited businesses in Bengaluru and did surveys to understand their problems.\n\nWe found that many businesses use software systems or do things manually for tasks like accounting, billing, GST filing and managing inventory.\n\nThey use software, like Tally, Petpooja, Zoho Books, Vyapar and Khatabook.\n\nThese solutions do not cover all their needs.\n\nThey are also not affordable or simple to use.\n\nOur goal is to solve these problems by providing a platform.\n\nThis platform will make it easy for businesses to manage their operations.\n\nIt will also help them with accounting, billing, GST filing and inventory management.\n\nWe want to make it affordable and simple for all businesses to use.",
