    "description": "The Telemedicine System is a way for people to get help from doctors over the internet. This project is mainly about letting patients talk to doctors online so they do not have to go to the hospital. This saves time for patients and doctors.\n\nThe Telemedicine System lets patients sign up make appointments talk to doctors using video or text and get prescriptions and medical advice online. Doctors can use the system to keep track of information schedule appointments and give patients advice on how to get better.\n\nThe system has security to keep information safe and it helps doctors manage appointments and store patient records. This project is really helpful for people who live in areas where it's hard to find doctors. It also helps when someone needs to talk to a doctor away.\n\nThe Telemedicine System is easy to use. It helps patients and doctors talk to each other in a better way using modern technology. The Telemedicine System is a thing because it helps people get medical help when they need it and it reduces the number of people, in hospitals. The Telemedicine System supports people who need to talk to doctors and it is a good way to get medical help at home.",
