    "description": "Our project is based on reducing food wastage and helping needy people through smart food redistribution. Large amounts of fresh excess food from restaurants, hotels, and supermarkets are often discarded because there is no quick and organized way to distribute it. At the same time, many people still suffer from hunger and lack of proper meals. The main purpose of our project is to connect food providers with nearby NGOs and volunteers through a mobile application. Restaurants can upload details such as food quantity, preparation time, pickup time, and location. Nearby NGOs receive instant notifications and collect the food for distribution. The project helps reduce environmental pollution, financial loss, and food wastage while supporting poor and homeless communities. Key features include real-time notifications, location-based NGO matching, food safety details, pickup coordination, and optional future features like temperature monitoring and smart storage systems.",
    "end_users": "The intended end users of our project are:\n\n* Restaurants\n* Hotels\n* Supermarkets\n* NGOs\n* Volunteers\n* Poor and needy people"
