    "description": "EcoNutri Sight – FoodGuard AI is an AI-driven hygiene surveillance system designed to transform food safety monitoring in canteens and food service environments. Traditional hygiene inspection methods are mostly manual and reactive, which often leads to delayed action and inconsistent monitoring. EcoNutri Sight introduces an automated and intelligent alternative using real-time AI detection.\nThe system uses computer vision and machine learning to monitor live video feeds through webcams. It can detect hygiene violations such as absence of gloves, unsafe serving practices, and unhygienic surroundings. Once detected, the system instantly labels the environment, saves violation evidence, records footage, and maintains detailed reports for future analysis.\nDeveloped using Python, OpenCV, and YOLO AI models, the project combines automation, surveillance, and smart reporting into a single platform. The system minimizes human dependency while improving monitoring accuracy and operational efficiency.\nEcoNutri Sight aims to create safer food environments, reduce contamination risks, and encourage better hygiene practices through the power of artificial intelligence and real-time monitoring technology",
