    "description": "Our project focuses on creating a smart and simplified platform for booking food and cab services, specially designed for people who struggle with complex mobile applications. Many users, especially senior citizens and beginners, find modern apps confusing because of too many features and difficult navigation. Our system aims to provide a stress-free digital experience with an easy interface and guided booking process.\nThe application enables users to order food from nearby restaurants and book cab rides in just a few simple steps. Features such as large buttons, voice-guided instructions, regional language support, quick booking options, live ride tracking, and secure payment methods make the platform more comfortable to use. The project also reduces dependency on others for online bookings and encourages digital inclusion.\nThe primary objective of this project is to bridge the gap between technology and non-technical users by making essential online services simple, fast, and accessible for everyone.",
