    "description": "The Smart Agriculture Platform is an AI-based application developed to help farmers improve productivity, profitability, and decision-making in agriculture. Farmers often face challenges such as unpredictable weather conditions, lack of crop price awareness, dependency on middlemen, limited access to farming tools, and difficulty in assessing crop quality. This project provides a single digital platform that offers real-time weather alerts, live crop price forecasting, AI-based crop quality and disease analysis, direct farmer–trader communication, and marketplace services for agricultural resources. Farmers can upload crop images to receive quality reports and disease detection results using AI technology. The system also helps farmers connect directly with traders, reducing dependency on intermediaries and ensuring fair pricing. Additional features such as tool rental systems, multilingual voice assistance, and eco-friendly farming support make the platform more accessible and user-friendly for rural communities. Overall, the project aims to promote smart farming, improve transparency in crop trading, reduce financial losses, and support sustainable agricultural practices.",
    "end_users": "Farmers"
