    "description": "Digital platform for small farmers and cooperatives \nA digital platform for small farmers and cooperatives helps improve agricultural productivity, market access, and income generation. It connects farmers with buyers, suppliers, banks, and agricultural experts through mobile apps or websites. Farmers can access real-time information about weather, crop prices, fertilizers, pest control, and modern farming techniques. Cooperatives can manage resources, share equipment, and coordinate sales efficiently. The platform also supports online payments, loan applications, and direct marketing, reducing dependence on middlemen. By using digital technology, small farmers gain better decision-making abilities, improved transparency, and higher profits. Such platforms promote sustainable agriculture and strengthen rural economic development and farmer empowerment.",
