    "description": "The AI Interview Monitoring and Detection System is an advanced AI-powered platform developed to ensure fairness, transparency, and security during online interviews. The system uses technologies such as Computer Vision, Natural Language Processing (NLP), Speech Analysis, and Behavioral Intelligence to monitor candidate activities in real time. It analyzes webcam video, facial expressions, eye movements, speech patterns, voice behavior, and response timing to detect suspicious activities, AI-assisted cheating, impersonation, or external help during interviews.\n\nUnlike traditional proctoring systems, this project focuses on multimodal interview intelligence, where multiple data sources are combined to generate fraud probability scores and real-time alerts for recruiters. The system helps companies, universities, placement cells, and online assessment platforms conduct secure and trustworthy remote interviews while reducing hiring fraud and maintaining interview integrity.",
