    "description": "Digital Market Access for Sustainable Farming (DMASS) is a voice-assisted farmer e-commerce platform designed to help farmers sell their agricultural products directly to customers without the involvement of middlemen. Many rural and uneducated farmers face difficulties using online applications due to language barriers and lack of digital knowledge. This project solves the problem by providing a simple multilingual voice-based system where farmers can easily login, add products, confirm orders, and track deliveries using voice commands. Customers can directly purchase fresh farm products from farmers through the platform. The system also provides order tracking, payment updates, delivery support, and cancellation options. DMASS helps improve farmer income, supports sustainable farming, and makes digital technology easier for rural communities.",
