    "description": "The “E-Waste Disposal Using Vending Machine with Reward System” project is a smart and automated system designed to encourage proper disposal of electronic waste such as batteries, chargers, earphones, and small electronic components. The machine uses sensors and a microcontroller to detect and collect e-waste safely, and in return it provides rewards like coupons, points, or tokens to users for promoting environmentally responsible behavior. The collected waste is stored separately for recycling and safe processing, helping reduce environmental pollution and spreading awareness about sustainable e-waste management. This project combines embedded systems, automation, and green technology to create an efficient and user-friendly solution suitable for public places like colleges, malls, and offices.",
