    "description": "SafeTour is a mobile-based urban safety intelligence application designed to help people travel more safely within Bangalore. The application provides users with important safety features such as SOS emergency support, live location sharing, regional safety scores, and interactive safety heatmaps. SafeTour collects and processes information from trusted sources like NCRB records, local news publications, Reddit discussions, and civic datasets to generate understandable safety insights for different areas of the city. Unlike traditional navigation apps that focus only on speed and distance, SafeTour focuses on traveler safety and awareness. The platform aims to help tourists, women travelers, students, and daily commuters make safer travel decisions and improve confidence while moving through unfamiliar locations.",
    "end_users": "SafeTour is intended for tourists, solo travelers, women travelers, students, working professionals, and daily commuters who need better safety awareness while traveling through unfamiliar areas in Bangalore."
