    "description": "H2Go is a one stop solution for your drinking water needs. It consists of a website, which compiles sources of clean drinking water such as government water filtration pumps, private filtration pumps, public water fountains and so on, using crowd sourced inputs thus making it a community. Along with addresses and contact information about these water dispensing kiosks being available for anyone to see, the quality of water provided by each dispenser should be visible as a rating int eh format of a custom rating system based on pH, TDS and heavy metal concentrations in the water. This information about quality can be crowdsourced with the help of our other product, the H2Go water tester. It is a handheld device that has sensors in it that register the above mentioned parameters and send that information to the website which calculates it's rating for all to see.",
