    "description": "Worker Connect is a digital workforce recruitment platform designed to simplify the hiring process between textile factories and workers, especially migrant and semi-literate labourers. The project aims to solve major industry challenges such as labour shortages, high employee turnover, unreliable hiring methods, and limited access to verified job opportunities. Currently, many workers depend on contractors, middlemen, or informal networks to find employment, which often leads to exploitation and job insecurity. Worker Connect provides an inclusive and easy-to-use solution through features such as voice-assisted navigation, regional language support, icon-based interfaces, and simple profile creation. These features make the platform accessible to workers with limited literacy or digital experience. Employers can post vacancies, review worker skills, and recruit efficiently, while workers gain direct access to stable employment opportunities. By improving transparency, accessibility, and communication, Worker Connect promotes fair employment practices, strengthens workforce stability, and supports economic growth in the industrial sector.",
