    "description": "The AI Personal Finance Tracker is a smart financial management application designed to help users track expenses, manage budgets, and improve savings habits using Artificial Intelligence. The project aims to provide users with an easy and intelligent way to monitor their financial activities and make better financial decisions.\nThe application allows users to record daily income and expenses, categorize transactions, and set monthly budgets. It also generates charts and reports to help users understand their spending patterns. Unlike traditional finance applications that only track past transactions, this system uses AI techniques to analyze user behavior and predict future expenses and savings.\nThe project includes important modules such as User Authentication, Expense Tracking, Budget Management, AI Prediction, and Financial Reporting. Users receive alerts when expenses exceed budget limits and get personalized recommendations to improve financial planning.\nThe front end is developed using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React.js, while Node.js and Express.js are used for backend development. MySQL or MongoDB is used for database management, and Python-based machine learning libraries are used for AI functionalities.\nOverall, the project promotes financial awareness, smart budgeting, and intelligent financial planning through automation and Artificial Intelligence.",
