    "description": "AI Based Smart Energy Management and Rooftop Solar Implementation\nThis project aims to develop an intelligent energy management system integrated with rooftop solar panels for efficient power utilization. The system uses AI algorithms to monitor energy generation, battery status, and electricity consumption in real time. Solar energy is utilized as the primary power source, while excess energy is stored in batteries for later use. The AI controller analyzes usage patterns and automatically switches between solar power, battery backup, and grid supply to reduce energy wastage and electricity costs. The system also provides energy-saving suggestions through a user interface. This project promotes renewable energy usage, improves energy efficiency, and supports sustainable and eco-friendly power management.",
